    description: "UAT 2026-04-13 BUG-19: detekt is a pure Kotlin static-analysis tool with no React code but reports 'react' as detected. Likely triggered by test fixtures or documentation containing JSX-like syntax. Investigate trigger; tighten the React pattern (require both JSX-like syntax AND a manifest signal like package.json `react` dep). Also consider a minimum-confidence threshold for framework labels."  # a207
