  message: "Fixed in PR #3054 (commit 2f2d54b75). _find_manifest_files now skips manifests inside test-fixture directories via paths.is_test_file. Prevents false-positive framework labels from test fixtures (e.g., detekt's Kotlin test fixtures contain package.json with react dep). 2 new tests."  # 4eff
